    "name_raw": "Greater Trip",
    "definition_type_raw": "Combat",
    "source_book_raw": "Pathfinder RPG Core Rulebook",
    "definition_raw": "You can make free attacks on foes that you knock down.\n\nPrerequisites: Combat Expertise, Improved Trip, base attack bonus +6, Int 13.\n\nBenefit: You receive a +2 bonus on checks made to trip a foe. This bonus stacks with the bonus granted by Improved Trip. Whenever you successfully trip an opponent, that opponent provokes attacks of opportunity.\n\nNormal: Creatures do not provoke attacks of opportunity from being tripped.",
